# EmoGame — Backlog

> Prioritized, measurable backlog. Checked items have code + tests or a dated
> reconciliation report that verify the stated outcome. Current snapshot
> 2026-09-05: 960 skins, 49 cash records, 960 full value scores, 365 revenue
> days, and 798 verified local image bindings.

## P0 — Dashboard correctness (2026-07-17 amendment)

- [x] Data Workbench runtime: no `app.evidence_table` ImportError; every tab
      renders. (regressed by `tests/test_dashboard_pages.py::test_workbench_page_no_import_error`)
- [x] Value-present scoring through the real `RuleEngine`: every catalog skin
      receives six aspect scores and a composite. Observed community dimensions
      override catalog estimates; missing dimensions are completed
      deterministically. Publication, model-quality gates, and human-audit
      status never suppress a present score. (`test_partial_observation_is_completed_in_detail`,
      `test_detail_page_value_score_is_never_withheld_by_old_status`,
      `test_build_payload_uses_completed_value_score_in_cash_metrics`)
- [x] Cash / emotion separation: opinion-only signal read path
      (`MarketSignalRepository.get_opinion_signals`) never injects cash-derived
      `sales_volume` / `avg_spend_cny` into emotional evaluation.
      (`test_cash_not_injected_into_emotion`)
- [x] Period-consistent cash resolution: `period_start`/`period_end` threaded
      through overview, explorer, and detail; cash resolved within the window.
      Reversed period rejected with a clear UI message. (`test_period_scoped_cash`)
- [x] Native CNY included directly; USD excluded from the CNY aggregate but kept
      visible for audit. (`test_usd_excluded_from_cny_aggregate`)
- [x] Release events plotted visibly on the revenue timeline (not just a caption).
      Release dates and revenue now both respect `period_start` / `period_end`;
      the optional online-date range is an additional intersection.
      (`test_release_events_respect_analysis_and_online_periods`)
- [x] Missing-last sorting (`dashboard.format.sort_missing_last`) and safe
      empty-result explorer (no enabled fallback selector/button on zero rows).
      (`test_explorer_zero_result_has_no_enabled_detail_button`)
- [x] Missing/partial database fails closed: read paths never call `ensure_schema`
      and never create files or tables. This covers overview, detail, timeline,
      summary, evidence, cash, and market-signal reads; explicit import/write
      paths retain schema initialization. (`test_missing_db_fails_closed`,
      `test_partial_db_no_skins_table`,
      `test_summary_and_evidence_reads_do_not_create_missing_db`)

