## P2 — Platform follow-ups

- [ ] Cold-start database initializer as a separate deliverable covering every
      required schema (skins, market signals, cash value, revenue). Read paths
      must stay fail-closed; only this initializer creates schema.
- [ ] AutoDL / VLM: validated endpoint + model choice (AutoDL `gpt-5.4-mini` L3,
      `qwen2.5vl:3b` L1/L2), credential contract, smoke test, and fallback.

## Fixed assumptions

- Five-page layout: portfolio overview, explorer, detail, perceived-premium
  radar, and separate data workbench.
- Cash value, perceived value-for-money, and emotional score are independent
  measures — never fused into one "total value".
- Perceived-premium pilot results remain a fourth, artifact-backed construct;
  they are not written into emotion or market-signal tables.
- Never replace missing values with zero. Complete missing scoring dimensions
  with the explicit deterministic catalog estimate and retain per-aspect source
  labels.


